    "created_at": "2021-02-15T13:07:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-02-15T13:07:47Z",
    "body": "> @fred-wang it would be great if you could enumerate all the other callers of that algorithm.\r\n\r\nWork on https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1153336 is not complete yet but basically:\r\n\r\n* There are 3 places that are currently a bit unclear spec-wise : https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/qtMVkfpd3_U\r\n\r\n* There are about 63 uses which would need further analysis ; to display them click the keyword on https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/master:services/network/public/cpp/is_potentially_trustworthy.h;l=39;bpv=1;bpt=1?q=network::IsURLPotentiallyTrustworthy \r\n\r\nNote that call sites may add more restrictions to \"is url potentially trustworthy\" (e.g. restriction to a specific scheme which make data:  and about: irrelevant in that case).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
